y-sized+bags+of+chips%2C+while+his+mother+waits+in+the+car+outside.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+Leo+in+a+convenience+store%2C+holding+two+drinks%2C+and+considering+purchasing+two-family+sized+%E2%80%98Buy-One-Get-One%27+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnThe+Wells+Fargo+Clear+Access+Banking+account+monthly+service+fee+is+%245.+Minimum+opening+deposit+is+%2425.+Other+limitations+apply%2C+see+the+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Account+Fee+and+Information+Schedule+and+Deposit+Account+Agreement+for+details.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+To+Leo%2C+Buy-One-Get-One+snacks+means+maximizing+his+savings+potential.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+grabs+the+two+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+walks+over+to+the+register+and+places+the+drinks+and+chips+on+the+counter.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+taps+his+card+to+the+scanner+to+pay+the+%246.93+total+for+his+items.+Payment+is+approved.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo%E2%80%99s+mom+watches+Leo+exit+with+his+items+looking+unexpectedly+at+his+purchase.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%2C%22isCrawlable%22%3Atrue%2C%22thumbnail%22%3A%7B%22thumbnails%22%3A%5B%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEiCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ%3D%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLBuPLSj6314TIeprcYfhM5SZpL4eg%22%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A94%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEiCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ%3D%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLBqyEI9e4OSAqiXz6PaRmn4mdbhxw%22%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A110%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEjCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLCwlMzKewJDiOLmzKpUs23GQ58bLg%22%2C%22width%22%3A246%2C%22height%22%3A138%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi